1
00:00:00,042 --> 00:00:01,126
Are you leaving
the group?

2
00:00:01,251 --> 00:00:02,876
[2 years ago]
[Alphadog's dorm]

3
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,080
You even
eavesdrop on me now?

4
00:00:07,216 --> 00:00:08,550
Are you leaving
the group?

5
00:00:08,675 --> 00:00:10,219
Lower your voice

6
00:00:10,344 --> 00:00:11,470
It's not decided yet

7
00:00:12,804 --> 00:00:14,181
You cowardly bastard

8
00:00:14,306 --> 00:00:15,641
You shouldn't
say that to me

9
00:00:17,601 --> 00:00:18,894
I know you're the one
who spread

10
00:00:20,062 --> 00:00:21,730
all those dirty rumors
about me

11
00:00:24,691 --> 00:00:26,652
We got here after
a hard time together

12
00:00:27,903 --> 00:00:29,051
but I was the only one

13
00:00:29,135 --> 00:00:30,405
who got all
the attention

14
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:34,576
I understand
how hard it was for you

15
00:00:34,701 --> 00:00:36,912
You couldn't help it
to vent your anger on me

16
00:00:38,038 --> 00:00:39,498
That's why
I just let it slide

17
00:00:40,666 --> 00:00:41,666
But now

18
00:00:42,459 --> 00:00:43,899
you're even saying that
I'm a coward?

19
00:00:47,798 --> 00:00:49,299
Okay then

20
00:00:49,424 --> 00:00:51,009
I won't stop you
from leaving here

21
00:00:52,719 --> 00:00:53,719
But

22
00:00:54,596 --> 00:00:56,390
please stay until
our next album is out

23
00:00:56,515 --> 00:00:57,641
Why should I?

24
00:01:00,811 --> 00:01:02,813
My throat condition
is very bad now

25
00:01:02,938 --> 00:01:05,107
I'm not sure if I could
hold up on the stage

26
00:01:05,232 --> 00:01:06,900
If you just leave
like this now

27
00:01:07,025 --> 00:01:08,860
there will be
no next album for us

28
00:01:08,986 --> 00:01:10,696
and our group
will be over

29
00:01:10,821 --> 00:01:11,821
I mean

30
00:01:12,739 --> 00:01:15,575
please do me a favor
for the last time

31
00:01:15,701 --> 00:01:18,370
I'll kneel down
if you want me to

32
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:22,143
I heard
you lost your mind

33
00:01:22,227 --> 00:01:24,209
since our group
disbanded after I left

34
00:01:24,334 --> 00:01:25,877
You might think of me
as a traitor

35
00:01:26,003 --> 00:01:28,255
You totally
ruined my life

36
00:01:28,380 --> 00:01:30,590
Don't pretend to be nice
after all of that

37
00:01:30,716 --> 00:01:31,716
It's disgusting

38
00:01:36,013 --> 00:01:37,139
Oh, right

39
00:01:37,264 --> 00:01:38,765
I'm glad you came today

40
00:01:38,890 --> 00:01:41,560
Watch me what I'm doing
with your lover
